SwapModule_Validate
├── when targetToken is zero address
│   └── it should return false with "Zero target token"
├── when dexRouter is zero address
│   └── it should return false with "Zero DEX router"
├── when input equals output token
│   └── it should return false with "Same input and output token"
├── when caller has insufficient balance
│   └── it should return false with "Insufficient balance"
├── when multiple validations fail
│   └── it should return the first failing validation
└── when all validations pass
    ├── it should return true with empty reason
    ├── it should return true when balance equals amount
    └── it should return true for any valid amount [fuzz]
